% Cyclic `=` via a self-referential list: X = [a | X] (an infinite list). Same
% F-069-1 crash class as cyclic_eq (069 DEC F3 excluded these); post-077 it must
% compile to a Cyclic-term diagnostic, never a StackOverflow.
Sym ::= a ; b.
CList ::= [] ; [Sym | CList].
procedure loopl(CList).
loopl(X) :- X = [a | X?] | true.
